ve victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player or Co-op</h2>There are 20 one-player levels, and 20 more two-player levels, for approximately 5 hours of gameplay.<br>In co-op, you get just as many powers as in single player, so you have to share these powers between yourselves in order to reach the goal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Own Disq</h2>Players can choose between eight colours and eight accessories to customise their character, an amicable individual named Disq.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision Is Key</h2>You can plan your way through a stage, or figure it out through trial and error. Either way, hitting a hazard resets the level. This game is best played by people who are patient and dedicated to success!<br>A practice stage is available if you want to work on a particular motion in a safe environment.", "short_description": "Platfuzzles is a game with short levels where you need to figure out how to reach your powers and use them to get to the goal. It's a platformer with puzzle elements. Jump, dash, pound, shoot, turn invisible and slow down objects to achieve victory!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069160/header.jpg?t=1662356906", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1662356906", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1662356906", "website": "https://www.hydrargyria.com/platfuzzles", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Hydrargyria"], 